        "description": "Positive family history consistent with autosomal dominant inheritance",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of clinical neuropathy, electrophysiological confirmation of axonal neuropathy, and pathogenic MED25 mutation",
    "notes": "Genetic testing is essential for definitive diagnosis due to phenotypic overlap with other CMT subtypes."
